# web/build/ is no longer committed — Docker's own image build always
# runs a fresh `pnpm run build` from web/src/ (Dockerfile's
# frontend-build stage), so there's no committed copy to keep in sync.
# Still produced locally by `cd web && pnpm run build` for bare-metal
# dev/testing; just not tracked.
web/build/

# BrowseComp dataset/results (cmd/benchmark.go) — OpenAI's canary/leakage
# note asks that examples not be republished in plain text, and the run
# outputs (decrypted questions/answers/harness responses) fall under the
# same ask.
benchmark/data/
benchmark-results*.jsonl
polaris-benchmark.db*
benchmark-tracking.db*
